    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p>This accessory is installed on search-and-rescue <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a> sent to recover pilots who bailout during combat. The small oxygen tank attached to the Droid's torso provides enough oxygen for a creature of Medium size for 30 minutes. The tank can be used to recharge a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum_Pod\" title=\"Vacuum Pod\">Vacuum Pod's</a> supply, or the oxygen can be administered through a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Breath_Mask\" title=\"Breath Mask\">Breath Mask</a> attached to the tank. Connecting the supply to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum_Pod\" title=\"Vacuum Pod\">Vacuum Pod</a> is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>. Securing the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Breath_Mask\" title=\"Breath Mask\">Breath Mask</a> is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>.</p>",
    "source": "Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids",
    "cost": "200",
    "weight": "20 Kilograms"
  },
